categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","review_id":"JVBF8v68Bs6zSmfzu1dY6w","date":"2015-11-28T18:36:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9430375099182129,"text_excerpt":"Been to the Half Shell twice now and both times have been great. I have partake in Brunch and dinner. One with two people and another with 5 people. Both experiences were good. The waitresses were friendly and helpful and actually gave useful recommendations on the things we should try! Food. It was great and enough to share with others or eat for the next day. I love the Catfish and Shrimp Platter. Comes with ample shrimp and catfish also fries and then an additional side!! When you think side, normally you would think a tiny little cup. But nooooo its huge greatness. This time my side was the red beans. I'm not even a big beans person but their beans were life changing. So wonderful wit..."},{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","review_id":"qJCKnnEIaTcIKBvvuDCXQA","date":"2017-03-24T17:45:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9317140579223633,"text_excerpt":"This place doesnt look like much from the outside but, I walk by frequently and its been here for a minute, so thought I would give it a try. Upon entering, it's got a classic \"down home\" and divey vibe. It's cute, it's clean, and cozy. The service is friendly and top notch! Once in the front door, I had a call out from the bar to sit wherever I'd like. They have outdoor seating but it wasnt offered on this day - likely due to a gusty wind outside. So I opted for a high top in a window, overlooking beautiful Esplanade Avenue! I would describe the menu as typical NOLA fare. Im dieting and was so pleased to also see some awesome salads on the menu as well. I opted for a half dozen oysters o..."},{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","review_id":"ar_NgWXGqi0Ak0SuT27kWA","date":"2016-10-23T19:51:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9220722913742065,"text_excerpt":"Went there last night. I had the voodoo blue chargrilled oysters which are chargrilled oysters with blue cheese and bacon. I was in seventh heaven!! The oyster dishes were served with garlic French bread which soaked up all the left over juices. My wife had their oyster sampler which she loved. We both had the mango daiquiris which really tasted like fresh mangos. We liked them so much we ordered seconds to take home. The service was a bit slow but they were hand shucking the oysters at the bar so they were fresh. We will definitely be back soon."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","photo_id":"duOGDQYlbfWXts4NMhN4zA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/duOGDQYlbfWXts4NMhN4zA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8244400024414062},{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","photo_id":"rbAHbfqKUJtxOclDvGSGUA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rbAHbfqKUJtxOclDvGSGUA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8237103223800659},{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","photo_id":"A9qhF6-R-8GffhxSh46Ing","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/A9qhF6-R-8GffhxSh46Ing.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8011051416397095},{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","photo_id":"oDe4Gv_2crBmzzephFwWRg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/oDe4Gv_2crBmzzephFwWRg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7454310655593872},{"business_id":"Se9CEgJEVxcWax1fStWuQA","photo_id":"50UKmuPtxCuf_yd1rJ4CHg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/50UKmuPtxCuf_yd1rJ4CHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7087539434432983}]},"notebook_case":null}
